==Strategy==
To clear this stage, you will need at least 2 meatshields (such as [[Wall Cat]] and [[Crazed Wall Cat]]). Since there's incoming [[Brollow]]s spam, you need to rush the stage as quick as possible; [[Courier Cat]] and [[Butterfly Cat]] will do the job for you. For extra peon-clearing, you can add [[Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] to destroy the [[Trolly Blogger]]s, as well as any other unit with wave ability.

